          "iast": "sa śarīraḥ gamiṣyasi",
          "devanagari": "स शरीरः गमिष्यसि",
          "meaning": "with, body, you can go - to heaven.",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
