        7
      ],
      "devanagari": "सर्वान् शिष्यान् समाहूय वाक्यमेतदुवाच ह |\nसर्वानृषिवरान् वत्सा आनयध्वं ममाज्ञया\nसशिष्यान् सुहृदश्चैव सर्त्विजः सुबहुश्रुतान् |",
      "iast": "sarvān śiṣyān samāhūya vākyam etat uvāca ha |\nsarvān ṛṣi varān vaśiṣṭhān ānayadhvam mama ājñayā\nsa śiṣyān suhṛdaḥ caiva sa ṛtvijaḥ subahu śrutān |",
      "translation": "\"Vishvamitra calling forth all of his disciples said this sentence, 'invite all the eminent sages who are well-read in many Veda-s, along with their disciples and friends, and their ritwiks, the conductors of rituals, and even the sons of Vashishta, at my order.",
