    {
      "id": "1.59.8",
      "label": "1.59.8",
      "numbers": [
        8
      ],
      "devanagari": "यदन्यो वचनं ब्रूयान्मद्वाक्यबलचोदितः\nतत्सर्वमखिलेनोक्तं ममाख्येयमनादृतम् |",
      "iast": "yat anyo vacanam brūyāt mat vākya bala coditaḥ\ntat sarvam akhilena uktam mama ākhyeyam anādṛtam |",
      "translation": "\" 'If someone speaks inconsiderately incited by the forcefulness of my word, whoever speaks it, whichever word it may be, all that is to be reported to me, whatever it is.' Thus Vishvamitra ordered his disciples.",
