      "devanagari": "तस्य तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा दिशो जग्मुस्तदाज्ञया\nआजग्मुरथ देशेभ्यः सर्वेभ्यो ब्रह्मवादिनः |",
      "iast": "tasya tat vacanam śrutvā diśo jagmuḥ tat ājñayā\nājagmuḥ atha deśebhyaḥ sarvebhyo brahma vādinaḥ |",
      "translation": "\"On listening that word of Vishvamitra his disciples went to all directions inviting all by his order, and then the Vedic scholars started to arrive from all provinces. [1-59-9 b, 10a]",
