    {
      "id": "1.59.11",
      "label": "1.59.11",
      "numbers": [
        11
      ],
      "devanagari": "श्रुत्वा ते वचनं सर्वे समायान्ति द्विजातयः\nसर्वदेशेषु चागच्छन् वर्जयित्वा महोदयम् |",
      "iast": "śrutvā te vacanam sarve samāyānti dvijātayaḥ\nsarva deśeṣu ca agacchan varjayitvā mahāudayam |",
      "translation": "\" 'On listening your word all the Brahmans from all provinces have started to come and some have already come, leaving alone Mahodaya, the son of Vashishta.' Thus, the disciples have started to inform Vishvamitra.",
