    {
      "id": "1.59.14",
      "label": "1.59.14",
      "numbers": [
        14
      ],
      "devanagari": "ब्राह्मणा वा महात्मानो भुक्त्वा चण्डालभोजनम्\nकथं स्वर्गं गमिष्यन्ति विश्वामित्रेण पालिताः |",
      "iast": "brāhmaṇā vā mahātmāno bhuktvā caṇḍāla bhojanam\nkatham svargam gamiṣyanti viśvāmitreṇa pālitāḥ |",
      "translation": "\" 'Though the Brahmans or the high-souled sages are now embarrassed by Vishvamitra, how can they go to heaven even after their demise, partaking of the food of a profaner?",
